ared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Q1hBOIqr_p6MRnMLawz6cA","review_id":"VVLbg8XWWbMbdXR5Y--aUg","date":"2019-10-29T16:55:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9421929717063904,"text_excerpt":"I have been waiting for this place to open up for sooooooo long and it finally did!! I'm A bit of a healthy eating nut and this place was right up my alley. I managed to snag a spot in the weekday around 1pm- ish and I did not have a reservation. I was seated immediately and the waiter was quite knowledgeable about all the dishes on the menu ( there is a lot of choice). I opted for the sparkling antioxidant tea ( super healthy) and it was delicious. I ordered the ancient grains bowl and added steak. Omg it was amaaaaazeballs! The steak was cooked exactly how I wanted it ( super juicy). The cilantro sauce ( I think that's what it was) just worked so well with all the ingredients and it tas..."},{"business_id":"Q1hBOIqr_p6MRnMLawz6cA","review_id":"iFh_3ZN8aBl0TOTGEn_k3Q","date":"2019-09-23T17:06:51","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9401174187660217,"text_excerpt":"A fresh and healthy concept with dishes full of flavor and cocktails that are good for you! True Food Kitchen is definitely a new kid on the block, but I can already tell this will be a popular spot in the Warehouse District. I attended the soft opening on last Friday and while I was skeptical about the oh so healthy dishes being bland and tasteless, I was definitely blown away with the presentation and flavor of the food and drinks as well as the atmosphere of the restaurant in general. One thing you immediately notice outside of the spot are the bathtub gardens full of fresh herbs such as basil and rosemary. While super trendy and cute, this adds a nice touch to the sustainable theme of..."},{"business_id":"Q1hBOIqr_p6MRnMLawz6cA","review_id":"DPmeOnDOxdH8wSIZDJTCQQ","date":"2019-12-17T04:03:55","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9373341202735901,"text_excerpt":"True Food Kitchen is my Happy Food Safe Space! I love this place from the first visit to this location! Atmosphere. The colors, it is just colorful and warm and promotes a great mood. You just want to be in a good mood when you visit! Along with this, the staff is just so sweet, happy, knowledgeable. They are helpful and know the menu and can give some great recommendations. I appreciate their staff. Every visit they always are friendly and welcoming! Food. First the drinks! I live for Beets! They had a cocktail called Beets by Jon! They let me change the vodka to whiskey in this cocktail and it was exceptional! I also love the Adaptogenic Tulsi Tea, their lemon to the honey combination w..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Q1hBOIqr_p6MRnMLawz6cA","photo_id":"V12ONbG3EUtujKgg1fvnkw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/V12ONbG3EUtujKgg1fvnkw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8990380764007568},{"business_id":"Q1hBOIqr_p6MRnMLawz6cA","photo_id":"xsYr3EA8RmtOOzI7eiRtjw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/xsYr3EA8RmtOOzI7eiRtjw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8662943840026855},{"business_id":"Q1hBOIqr_p6MRnMLawz6cA","photo_id":"OTaOfoWoq21MTpubJ_mIhA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/OTaOfoWoq21MTpubJ_mIhA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8324108123779297},{"business_id":"Q1hB